{"author":{"id":"dec876858d28babbadcead4137861bf586626b8518cbce9c5f4fc52ac3b424b8"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1794391107,"nonce":"VBoAu3fm2Qr9uHQmmX68XdzZUD4=","title":"GPU animation P5: paint tracks for colour, border, radius, shadow and filter parameters","message":"Part of the GPU-deferral plan (umbrella issue). Depends on P2. Do not start before the A14 measurement below.\n\nToday `apply_css_deltas` patches background, border colour and width, corner radius, box-shadow and the CSS colour filters in place by matching the old value exactly (`p.color == last_bg`), which is fragile. It leaves gradient colours and angle, text colour, outline, corner shape, mask, light and SVG properties, and `shadow_stack` out, and reports clip-path, blur, backdrop and size as out of scope (re-emit or full paint).\n\n**Tracks.** A track is `(node_slot, field)` plus a descriptor. These fields live in the primitive, so the shader can take the fill, border and radius from the track instead of the primitive. The decision to make on measured data: evaluate in the vertex stage and pass flat varyings, or have the CPU write an evaluated row. More varyings cost fragment-stage interpolators and mobile GPUs are already fill-bound (36c7812: the cost is in the fill colour, gradient table loop and border code, after the SDF distance). Measure on the A14 before choosing.\n\n**Layer effects.** Blur is Kawase with `passes = clamp(ceil(radius / 2), 2, 8)`, so an animated radius changes the pass count, and each effect adds a same-size texture and its own submit. Fix the pass count for an animation and drive the radius as a uniform. Colour matrix, drop shadow and glow parameters become uniform tracks.\n\n**Also:** gradient stops and angle (`@keyframes` cannot move gradient stops, f3b2da2), multi-shadow stacks, premultiplied sRGB interpolation identical to the CPU.\n\n**API.** CSS only. `KeyframeProperties` (about 70 Option fields) gains fields only after P0's `#[non_exhaustive]`.\n\nAcceptance: each property matches the CPU evaluation (per-machine goldens); A14 fragment cost not worse than the P0 baseline (xctrace); no silent staleness on the cases listed above.","files":null}]}